<title>UK: Citibank raises UK base rate to 6.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Citibank raises UK base rate to 6.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank said on Wednesday it was raising its UK base lending rate to 6.0 percent from 5.75 percent following the Bank of England's increase.</p>
<p>The rate rise was effective immediately, the bank said.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Bank of England raised UK interest rates by a quarter-point to six percent in a surprise move aimed at moderating the pace of Britain's economic upswing.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
